e and slowly figuring out what's wrong with it.<br>In battle, you attack and dodge through small minigames and enemies all have their own attack patterns.<br>Fights keep throwing new things at you and stay unpredictable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Movement isn't locked to a grid. You can move freely, jump, and there's actual elevation.<br>It makes exploring feel a bit more fun.   </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >JUMPING and ELEVATION</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TURN-BASED combat with MINIGAMES for attacking and dodging</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >on-screen enemy encounters (NO RANDOM battles)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a large cast of characters and funny dialogue</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >lots of hidden PUZZLES and SECRETS</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A CONCERNING AMOUNT OF MUSHROOMS</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are a lot of secrets if you look around. Hidden items, secret areas, and maybe even some secret boss fights?<br>The whole game is done in hand-drawn pixel art.</p>", "short_description": "SoulSide is a silly turn-based RPG. In battle, you attack and dodge through small minigames. Outside of combat, you explore a strange world and meet a lot of different characters. Bit by bit, you uncover what's really going on.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1813000/header.jpg?t=1784934137", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1813000/ec6a563cd48b66a0bccfcd6446148ee78358b633/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1784934137", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1813000/ec6a563cd48b66a0bccfcd6446148ee78358b633/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1784934137", "website": "https://soulside.